WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
Langley. Ethan is entering the vault.

00:06.500 --> 00:14.000
You are at Luther's support terminal.

00:14.000 --> 00:23.400
One personnel record remains protected by the archive AI.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Recover the real name behind NIGHTJAR.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Question the archive. Capture its reply, then eject the disk.
